    "notes": "Chest improved from 104 to 105 and shoulders moved from 101 to 102, both showing positive momentum. Back, biceps, and triceps all held their previous index values, meaning no regression but also no gain — flat progress that is fine for one period but should not persist. Legs are the one area to flag: the index slipped from 108 to 107, a minor regression. No cause for alarm after a single period, but it is worth prioritizing leg intensity next week to reverse the dip and continue the overall upward trend."
