    "Maintain the current chest and shoulder progression since both gained a strength index point this period — keep adding small increments of load rather than changing the exercise selection.",
    "Continue monitoring back and triceps closely; both held steady but did not advance, so look for an opportunity to add a small amount of load or a rep on a key lift next period to break the plateau."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "Chest and shoulders progressed, legs regressed slightly, back and arms held flat — leg recovery and biceps volume are the two areas to address next period."
}
